<p class="font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary">$1,250.00</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-6 group">
<div class="w-24 h-24 flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-container-highest overflow-hidden">
<img alt="Luxury Watch" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110" data-alt="Close-up shot of a sophisticated mechanical wristwatch with a midnight blue face and gold numerals, set against a dark, textured silk background. The lighting catches the polished surfaces and fine details of the watch hands. The overall mood is timeless and exclusive, perfectly aligned with a luxury digital flagship store." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCcpqubWnRN4fchRBOOnbJto2cVkKH-SvIDsRObVv5feqnKENr2rosDy7yM4_btQ9F9_VAQzQ3i82raUCQFnmlPHs9AohvdzRFCrLUXm8x4I68M5KHslYhBeo2uC812cnntqTxf_T3PUE12sVOtUC6JpGdZBU4aIWB08GVQusnwzbIAQguyj2LoDTovN04eaSeIqXHFqjYxjB51vTb1W2NR-vlO5DsWV71U57G_vZxzZnbNzcAcKav9pEBVPG4VnIa2SzCJh5qtDQg">
</div>
<div class="flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between py-1">
<div>
<h3 class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider">Midnight Horizon Watch</h3>
